{"id":"00079","root":"uni00079_1","name":{"ja":"ミリアム","en":"Merriam"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ミリアム","en":"Merriam"},"aliases":["Miriam"],"element":"Spiritual","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Magic"],"release":"2019-02-13","limited":false,"characterId":64,"profile":{"ja":"魔界に住む魔女の1人。絶大な魔力を持っていたが対魔忍達のお陰で命を狩られるところを命からがら逃げ延びることができた。だが彼女の絶大な魔力は対魔忍達によって封印されてしまう。そのお陰で身体は幼くなってしまい、数十年にわたる間その幼い身体のままで生活を送っている。力を封印されているといっても低俗な魔族なら葬り去ることのできる魔力を擁している。主な攻撃方法は使い魔に魔力を込め相手に向かって放つ。性格は幼い時の状態に戻ってしまっているが言葉遣いは尊大な口調である。本人的には元の身体に戻りたいのだが、封印された魔力がどこに隠されているのか解らない状態で若干諦めも入っている。ノマドの組織力を使い、自分の魔力と姿を取り戻そうと考えているのである。また本当の名前がばれると同族や魔界の別種族から命を狙われる可能性があるので今は別名を名乗っている。使い魔の名前、クロとシロ。","en":"Merriam is one of the witches who dwells in the Demon Realm. Though she once possessed overwhelming magical power, the Taimanin managed to hunt her down, allowing her to escape death by a hair's breadth. However, the Taimanin sealed her immense magic, causing her body to become childlike, and she has lived in that youthful form for decades. Even sealed, she still wields the kind of magic that ordinary demons could easily eradicate. Her main attack involves infusing her familiars with magic and launching them at foes. Her personality has regressed to that of a child, yet she speaks with an arrogant tone. She longs to regain her original body, but, unsure where her sealed power is hidden, she has grown somewhat resigned. Using the Nomad organization's resources, she plans to reclaim her magic and true form. Because revealing her real name would make her a target for her own kind and other Demon Realm races, she now goes by an alias. Her familiars are named Kuro & Shiro."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"姫川あいり","forms":[{"id":"uni00079_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[680,1360],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[115,231],"def":[105,209],"spd":[74,74],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","101301"]},{"id":"uni00079_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"